§ `Section 684`

#ASSERT `s 684(1) a court of appeal or a judge may assign counsel to act on behalf of an accused who is a party to an appeal` TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 684(1) a court of appeal or a judge may assign counsel to act on behalf of an accused who is a party to an appeal` FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 684(1) a court of appeal or a judge may assign counsel to act on behalf of an accused who is a party to an appeal` TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE   -- not desirable in the interests of justice
#ASSERT `s 684(1) a court of appeal or a judge may assign counsel to act on behalf of an accused who is a party to an appeal` TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE   -- the accused has sufficient means
#ASSERT `s 684(2) the fees and disbursements of the assigned counsel shall be paid by the Attorney General who is the appellant or respondent` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 684(2) the fees and disbursements of the assigned counsel shall be paid by the Attorney General who is the appellant or respondent` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE   -- legal aid was granted
#ASSERT `s 684(2) the fees and disbursements of the assigned counsel shall be paid by the Attorney General who is the appellant or respondent` FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 684(3) the Attorney General or the counsel may apply to the registrar of the court of appeal to tax the disputed fees and disbursements` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 684(3) the Attorney General or the counsel may apply to the registrar of the court of appeal to tax the disputed fees and disbursements` FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 684(3) the Attorney General or the counsel may apply to the registrar of the court of appeal to tax the disputed fees and disbursements` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE

§ `Section 685`

#ASSERT `s 685(1) the registrar may refer the appeal to the court of appeal for summary determination` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 685(1) the registrar may refer the appeal to the court of appeal for summary determination` FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 685(1) the court of appeal may dismiss the appeal summarily, without calling on any person to attend the hearing or to appear for the respondent` TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 685(1) the court of appeal may dismiss the appeal summarily, without calling on any person to attend the hearing or to appear for the respondent` FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 685(1) the court of appeal may dismiss the appeal summarily, without calling on any person to attend the hearing or to appear for the respondent` TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 685(1) the court of appeal may dismiss the appeal summarily, without calling on any person to attend the hearing or to appear for the respondent` TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING   -- it cannot be determined without a full hearing
#ASSERT `s 685(2) the registrar may refer the appeal to a judge of the court of appeal for summary determination` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 685(2) the registrar may refer the appeal to a judge of the court of appeal for summary determination` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
